== S6: bounded recovery keeps an uncertain seat counted and frees it only on proof ==
-- the launch owner died; its endpoint still holds a shell
fleet-seats: skipped id=task-d generation=g-d1: fleet-seats: retained - the endpoint for task-d generation g-d1 reads 'ambiguous' (the seat stays counted until evidence resolves it)
rc=0
-- the uncertain holder is still counted and still blocks the pool
g-d1 reserved dispatching
fleet-seats: pool shared is full (1 of 1 seats held); other gets no seat for model pool-model-a - choose an overflow route or wait for a holder to finish
  holder /tmp/fm-seat-live.1m3m8w/recovery-home/state task-d
rc=4
-- once the exact endpoint is proven destroyed, recovery reclaims exactly that generation
fleet-seats: reclaimed id=task-d generation=g-d1 (endpoint-gone)
rc=0
g-d1 reclaimed
fleet-seats: reserved pool=shared id=other generation=g-other used=1 capacity=1
rc=0
